# Server workspace (MAX Sender)

When working under `server/` or changing the admin UI for server deployment:

1. Load project skill `.cursor/skills/context-loading/SKILL.md`, then read `server/AGENTS.md` and `server/skills-curated/SKILL.md`.
2. Pick skills only from `server/skills-curated/manifest.json` — do **not** scan all of `server/skills/` (~1900 items).
3. Server-specific logic belongs in `server/app/`; keep local `run.bat` / exe flow working.
4. Stack: Docker Compose + Caddy (HTTPS) + FastAPI + Redis; UI is `static/index.html` (vanilla CSS).
5. Public deploy requires API PIN; never commit `server/.env` or `data/.app_key`.
6. New server features: `/start-feature` → assign `@devops-engineer` / `@security-engineer` as needed → `@verifier`.

Skill paths are relative to repo root, e.g. `server/skills/docker-expert/SKILL.md`.
Agent workflow: `docs/MASTER-AI-WORKFLOW.md`.
